\c 3
\d A Psalm of David, when he fled from Absalom his son.
\q1
\v 1 LORD, how my adversaries have increased!
\c 23
\d \v 1 A Psalm of David.\f + \fr 23:1 \ft The superscription is numbered as verse 1.\f*
\q1 The LORD is my shepherd;
\q2 I shall not want.
\q1
\v 2 He makes me lie down in green pastures.
